{"id": 96, "name": "Luo Yi", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e8f1e6dd0d7864b66bda10ef65242dd6.png", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Support", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["20", "100", "40", "50"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "Seeking to revive an ancient past, she is the sole being who has mastered the secrets of Yin and Yang.", "skills": [{"name": "Duality", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_55ccda55cadbf28d972b7878c6ed14fe.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Luo Yi's skills can create <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sigils of Yin/Yang</span> on the battlefield. Each Sigil lasts up to 6s.\nSigils of opposite attributes will trigger <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Yin-Yang Reaction</span> when they are within a certain distance, dealing 300 (+25*Hero Level) <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+190% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the marked enemies, stunning them for 0.3s, and pulling them toward each other.\nEach time Luo Yi applies a new Sigil to a marked enemy, she gains a 300 (+10*Hero Level) <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+150% Total Magic Power)</span> shield (up to 3 stacks) and 50% extra Movement Speed that decays over 2s."}, {"name": "Dispersion", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_05fb5366ff51181b744efcf51bc51dde.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 1.2   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Luo Yi casts the energy of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Yin/Yang</span> in the target direction, dealing 285<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+135% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the first enemy hit and those behind them in a fan-shaped area. Enemy heroes hit are marked with a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Sigil of Yin/Yang</span>.\nLuo Yi stores up to 4 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dispersion</span> charges and gains 1 charge every 8s. She also immediately gains 1 charge each time <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Yin-Yang Reaction</span> is triggered.\nThe state of this skill changes on each cast."}, {"name": "Rotation", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4e2479753eebe2d5bb68a2bc5875f74d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 75", "desc": "Luo Yi summons <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fire of Yang / Aqua of Yin</span> at the target location, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit and slowing them by 60% for 0.5s.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fire of Yang / Aqua of Yin</span> then remains at the location for 6s, dealing 50<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> every 0.7s to nearby enemies. It can also trigger <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Yin-Yang Reaction</span> with Sigils of opposite attributes.\nThe state of this skill changes on each cast."}, {"name": "Diversion", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_acb1a21a98666b2902d41370b8a18a77.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 82, "tagname": "Teleport", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Luo Yi's Cooldown Reduction is increased by 6%.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Luo Yi creates a Teleport Circle around herself and marks the target location (within 28 units) as its destination. After a 3s delay, allied heroes within the Circle will be teleported to the location."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Clock of Destiny", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_623986dee375d8a04101d626c02f6d36.png"}, {"name": "Ice Queen Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d1a51e6386475e91d2cb913020d24ab9.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "Guardian Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fc3154808d5848c4b3d28ea921ee58b9.png"}, {"name": "Blade Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_29d321d8fe1089a93f0e3f3c5a838ebd.png"}, {"name": "Holy Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_25c17fb08406548b8476673ce7fc3078.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Fighter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2153bf01770633e3251dea1f2ac6c956.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Inspire", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8d95d9a3bb304ebd45a08814b5c65434.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Festival of Blood", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_14e7521fcba0c60bb0128a6c3e223eaf.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Killing Spree", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_264b83700e778b3eaa4a62d8e7a22a6c.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Vengeance", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b9bccc6a8b4634cf64ef2829d72dba85.png"}}, {"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Genius Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f615aa7cb949d4e43d24561b12ff0e1.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Lightning Truncheon", "icon": "https://akm